{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-25212","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30508","text":"03 — Invocation Gateway"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30509","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-30510","text":" How agent invocations flow through the Edge Function gateway, including the canonical request/response shapes, authentication, limit checks, session handling, streaming, and error normalization."}]}],"id":"blk-25213","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-25215","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30511","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25216","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30512","text":"Gateway Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-25217","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30513","text":"The invocation gateway is a Supabase Edge Function at "},{"id":"spn-30514","marks":["code"],"text":"/functions/v1/invoke/:agentId"},{"id":"spn-30515","text":". It authenticates the caller, checks plan limits, resolves the active deployment, routes to the runtime provider adapter, and returns a normalized response."}]},{"id":"blk-25218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30516","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25219","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30517","text":"Request Shape ("},{"id":"spn-30518","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeRequest"},{"id":"spn-30519","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-25220","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeRequest {\n  input: {\n    messages?: Array<{\n      role: \"system\" | \"user\" | \"assistant\" | \"tool\";\n      content: string;\n    }>;\n    prompt?: string;  // converted to messages if provided\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;  // opaque; provider-specific\n  options?: {\n    maxSteps?: number;\n    temperature?: number;\n    toolPolicy?: { allow?: string[]; deny?: string[] };\n  };\n  metadata?: {\n    traceId?: string;\n    client?: string;\n  };\n}"},{"id":"blk-25221","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30520","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-30521","text":" If "},{"id":"spn-30522","marks":["code"],"text":"prompt"},{"id":"spn-30523","text":" is provided instead of "},{"id":"spn-30524","marks":["code"],"text":"messages"},{"id":"spn-30525","text":", the gateway converts it to "},{"id":"spn-30526","marks":["code"],"text":"[{ role: \"user\", content: prompt }]"},{"id":"spn-30527","text":" before forwarding."}]},{"id":"blk-25222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30528","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25223","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30529","text":"Response Shape ("},{"id":"spn-30530","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeResponse"},{"id":"spn-30531","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-25224","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeResponse {\n  output: {\n    text: string;\n    messages?: Array<{ role: string; content: string }>;\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;\n  usage: {\n    tokens?: number;\n    computeMs?: number;\n    toolCalls?: number;\n  };\n  traceId: string;\n  error?: NormalizedError;\n}"},{"id":"blk-25225","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30532","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25226","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30533","text":"Gateway Pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-25227","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Parse request\n2. Authenticate (Supabase Auth JWT)\n3. Load agent record (RLS-filtered)\n4. Verify agent.status === \"active\"\n5. Resolve active deployment + runtime provider\n6. Check plan limits (billing_usage vs tier limits)\n7. Generate traceId (if not provided)\n8. Route to RPI adapter: invoke(input, sessionId, options)\n9. Normalize response\n10. Return to caller"},{"id":"blk-25228","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30534","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25229","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30535","text":"Authentication"}]},{"id":"blk-25230","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30536","text":"All invocations require a valid Supabase Auth JWT in the "},{"id":"spn-30537","marks":["code"],"text":"Authorization"},{"id":"spn-30538","text":" header:"}]},{"id":"blk-25231","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Authorization: Bearer <supabase-jwt>"},{"id":"blk-25232","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30539","text":"The gateway extracts "},{"id":"spn-30540","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid()"},{"id":"spn-30541","text":" and uses it to load the agent via RLS. If the agent does not belong to the caller, the query returns empty and the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-30542","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"},{"id":"spn-30543","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-25233","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30544","text":"Post-MVP: per-agent API keys for public invocation."}]},{"id":"blk-25234","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30545","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25235","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30546","text":"Limit Checks"}]},{"id":"blk-25236","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30547","text":"Before routing to the provider, the gateway checks:"}]},{"id":"blk-25237","kind":"code","language":"sql","text":"SELECT total_requests, total_tokens, total_compute_ms\nFROM billing_usage\nWHERE user_id = auth.uid()\n  AND period_key = current_period();"},{"id":"blk-25238","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30548","text":"If any metric exceeds the user's tier limit, the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-30549","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"},{"id":"spn-30550","text":" without invoking the agent."}]},{"id":"blk-25239","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30551","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25240","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30552","text":"Session Handling"}]},{"id":"blk-25241","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25243","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30553","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-30554","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-30555","text":" is provided, it is forwarded to the provider as-is."}]}],"id":"blk-25242","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25245","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30556","text":"If absent, the provider may create a new session and return the "},{"id":"spn-30557","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-30558","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-25244","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25247","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30559","text":"The gateway treats "},{"id":"spn-30560","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-30561","text":" as "},{"id":"spn-30562","marks":["bold"],"text":"opaque"},{"id":"spn-30563","text":" -- never parses or validates it."}]}],"id":"blk-25246","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25249","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30564","text":"Session semantics are provider-specific (DO instance for Cloudflare, runtime"}]}],"id":"blk-25248","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-25250","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30565","text":"session for AgentCore)."}]},{"id":"blk-25251","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30566","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25252","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30567","text":"Streaming"}]},{"id":"blk-25253","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30568","text":"When the provider supports streaming, the gateway uses Server-Sent Events (SSE):"}]},{"id":"blk-25254","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Content-Type: text/event-stream\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\"Hello\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\" world\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"done\",\"usage\":{\"tokens\":12,\"computeMs\":340}}"},{"id":"blk-25255","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30569","text":"When a provider does not support true streaming, the gateway MAY emulate it by returning the full response as a single chunk followed by "},{"id":"spn-30570","marks":["code"],"text":"done"},{"id":"spn-30571","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-25256","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30572","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25257","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30573","text":"Error Normalization"}]},{"id":"blk-25258","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30574","text":"All errors are mapped to a standard code set:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-25260","spans":[{"id":"spn-30575","text":"Code"}]},{"id":"blk-25261","spans":[{"id":"spn-30576","text":"HTTP Status"}]},{"id":"blk-25262","spans":[{"id":"spn-30577","text":"Meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-25259","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-25263","spans":[{"id":"spn-30578","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHENTICATED"}]},{"id":"blk-25264","spans":[{"id":"spn-30579","text":"401"}]},{"id":"blk-25265","spans":[{"id":"spn-30580","text":"Missing or invalid JWT"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25266","spans":[{"id":"spn-30581","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHORIZED"}]},{"id":"blk-25267","spans":[{"id":"spn-30582","text":"403"}]},{"id":"blk-25268","spans":[{"id":"spn-30583","text":"Valid JWT but no access to this agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25269","spans":[{"id":"spn-30584","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"}]},{"id":"blk-25270","spans":[{"id":"spn-30585","text":"404"}]},{"id":"blk-25271","spans":[{"id":"spn-30586","text":"Agent does not exist (or not owned by caller)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25272","spans":[{"id":"spn-30587","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"}]},{"id":"blk-25273","spans":[{"id":"spn-30588","text":"429"}]},{"id":"blk-25274","spans":[{"id":"spn-30589","text":"Plan limit reached for this period"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25275","spans":[{"id":"spn-30590","marks":["code"],"text":"DEPLOYMENT_FAILED"}]},{"id":"blk-25276","spans":[{"id":"spn-30591","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-25277","spans":[{"id":"spn-30592","text":"No active deployment or deployment is broken"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25278","spans":[{"id":"spn-30593","marks":["code"],"text":"RUNTIME_ERROR"}]},{"id":"blk-25279","spans":[{"id":"spn-30594","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-25280","spans":[{"id":"spn-30595","text":"Provider returned an error during execution"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25281","spans":[{"id":"spn-30596","marks":["code"],"text":"INVALID_REQUEST"}]},{"id":"blk-25282","spans":[{"id":"spn-30597","text":"400"}]},{"id":"blk-25283","spans":[{"id":"spn-30598","text":"Malformed input or missing required fields"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-25284","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"LIMIT_EXCEEDED\",\n    \"message\": \"Monthly request limit reached. Upgrade your plan.\",\n    \"traceId\": \"tr_abc123\"\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-25285","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30599","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-30600","text":" Error messages must be safe for display. Never include secrets or internal stack traces."}]},{"id":"blk-25286","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30601","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25287","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30602","text":"Rate Limiting"}]},{"id":"blk-25288","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30603","text":"The gateway SHOULD enforce per-user and per-agent rate limits beyond plan quotas:"}]},{"id":"blk-25289","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25291","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30604","text":"Per-user: max N requests/second across all agents"}]}],"id":"blk-25290","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25293","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30605","text":"Per-agent: max M requests/second per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-25292","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25295","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30606","text":"Payload size: max 1 MB request body"}]}],"id":"blk-25294","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-25296","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30607","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25297","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30608","text":"Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-25298","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25300","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30609","text":"[ ] Every invocation is authenticated via Supabase Auth JWT"}]}],"id":"blk-25299","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25302","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30610","text":"[ ] Agent status is verified as "},{"id":"spn-30611","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-30612","text":" before routing"}]}],"id":"blk-25301","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25304","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30613","text":"[ ] Plan limits are checked before invoking the provider"}]}],"id":"blk-25303","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25306","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30614","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-30615","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-30616","text":" is generated or forwarded on every request"}]}],"id":"blk-25305","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25308","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30617","text":"[ ] Errors are normalized to the standard code set"}]}],"id":"blk-25307","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25310","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30618","text":"[ ] Error messages never contain secrets or internal details"}]}],"id":"blk-25309","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25312","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30619","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-30620","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-30621","text":" is treated as opaque"}]}],"id":"blk-25311","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25314","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30622","text":"[ ] Streaming uses SSE format when supported"}]}],"id":"blk-25313","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25316","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-30623","text":"[ ] Request payload size is validated"}]}],"id":"blk-25315","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierajpvjxsqagfnhjziute7xgmhvajieqtbdutf3rk2zr6aihiwrfq4q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}